17:29:14 run E27 20260918-172914: Does zeroing a vermin population entry stop that vermin appearing? This is the v5.9 Vermin panel's whole premise. Addendum 54 makes the test sharper than it was: two levers reach vermin and only one is safe — zeroing an ENTRY is the ordinary population mechanism, while zeroing a vermin's FREQUENCY is exactly what froze the game, since CREEPY_CRAWLER is a vermin and the only underground rotter. This arm zeroes entries only and never touches a frequency. A season on CTRL against an untouched control, two replicates each, tool disabled, counting live vermin objects by race.
